# Interpreter-throw closure item 3: a walker fault (12 / 0) with no handler in any walked method reaches the root:
# R0 stops with the key of interpreter (4) -- the source-level uncaught interpreter witness, every method walked.
fn: bad (int: n) int
    return: 12 / n

fn: relay (int: n) int
    return: bad(n)

int: result relay(0)
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: result; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
